<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 06:22:45 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a742832d2d6c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;继续《日常工作》的绘画系列，今天画的是莫迪凯，瑞格比最好的朋友。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A digital drawing of Mordecai from Regular Show striking an energetic, celebratory pose with both arms raised and one leg lifted. His blue feathers, striped arms and tail, and long gray beak stand out against a warm tan, paper-textured background. Clean black outlines and flat colors give the illustration a simple, hand-drawn look, with the artist's signature near the lower center." height="2242" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a742832d2d6c.jpg" width="1683"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 06:22:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>海湾大桥</title><link>https://some.pics/6a73fe7704e33</link><description>&lt;p&gt;海湾大桥&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A long bridge stretches across a bay." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6a73fe7704e33.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 03:24:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a73757606690</link><description>&lt;p&gt;休息中的博多。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Village cat relaxing in early evening sun." height="2000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/z428/6a73757606690.jpg" width="1125"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://z428.some.pics"&gt;@z428&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:40:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>《Herdling》游戏中途截图</title><link>https://some.pics/6a7369818ce9e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;游戏《Herdling》中途的截图。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A herd of Calicorns from the game Herdling are waiting by the side of a river for a way to cross it in the next obstacle to be negotiated in the game. There are 8 Calicorns, the fantasy animal in the game, of different sizes and colours. The river is wide and there are hills and snowy mountains beyond." height="900" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7369818ce9e.jpg" width="1600"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 16:49:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7368e3c2d7a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;来自游戏《Herdling》的截图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A herd of Calicorns from the game Herdling are waiting by the side of a river for a way to cross it in the next obstacle to be negotiated in the game. There are 8 Calicorns, the fantasy animal in the game, of different sizes and colours. The river is wide and there are hills beyond." height="900" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7368e3c2d7a.jpg" width="1600"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 16:46:31 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>